cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MFXerrorsSuppl"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-29"
abstract: >-
  Source images, numerical source data, acquisition metadata and Python
  plotting scripts accompanying the review "From MINFLUX localisation precision
  to biological positional accuracy: a critical review of error sources,
  diagnostics, and reporting". Includes calculation of the gradient quality
  factor, zero residual and azimuthal coefficient of variation from a
  nanoparticle back-scatter image of the excitation beam, the
  precision-retention filtering simulation, and generation of Figures 1-5.
